/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-247-  syntax EvPair ::= powCarryE(String, Int, EvPair) [function, total]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k-248-  rule powCarryE(O:String, N:Int, evp(OPS:OpSeq, NDS:IntSeq)) => evp(oCons(O, OPS), iCons(N, NDS))
